      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Text length after cleaning preview\n",
        "\n",
        "After removing blank text rows and exact duplicates, privacy-sensitive examples are still slightly longer on average than safe examples.\n",
        "\n",
        "This means the basic cleaning step does not really change the earlier text-length pattern. Length may be useful as a small feature, but it should not be treated as enough to detect PII by itself."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "oYcXsyFcPYDs"
      }
    },
